#: ../../effects_and_filters/video_effects/motion/freeze.rst:48
msgid ""
"This effect causes the video to freeze. By default, the clip will be frozen "
"for its entire length when the effect is added to the clip. To change this, "
"check either the :guilabel:`Freeze Before` or :guilabel:`Freeze After` "
"option and move the :guilabel:`Freeze at` slider to the time where you want "
"the freeze to start or end. The audio in the video plays for the entire "
"length, i.e. the **Freeze** effect does *not* affect the audio."
msgstr ""
"Tento efekt spôsobí zmrazenie videa. V predvolenom nastavení bude klip "
"zmrazený po celú svoju dĺžku po pridaní efektu. Ak to chcete zmeniť, "
"zaškrtnite možnosť :guilabel:`Zmraziť pred` alebo :guilabel:`Zmraziť po` a "
"posuňte posuvník :guilabel:`Zmraziť na` na čas, kde chcete zmrazenie začať "
"alebo skončiť. Zvuk vo videu sa prehráva po celú dĺžku, t. j. efekt "
"**Zmraziť** *neovplyvňuje* zvuk."

